# 启动教程

## 使用说明

默认每一步都建议新开一个终端执行，并且每个终端先进入工作空间后再执行：

```bash
cd /home/rera/robotcup2026
source devel/setup.bash
```

如果还没有启动 `roscore`，先在一个单独终端执行：

```bash
roscore
```

## 启动顺序

### 1. 启动 display

`display.launch` 里 `model` 参数没有默认值，建议这样启动：

```bash
roslaunch rebo24 display.launch model:=$(rospack find rebo24)/urdf/rebo24.urdf
```

### 2. 启动 senser

这里对应仓库里的 `sensor.launch`：

```bash
roslaunch rebo24 sensor.launch
```

### 3. 启动 mapping_velodyne

```bash
roslaunch fast_lio mapping_velodyne.launch
```

### 4. 启动 vehicle_cropbox_filter

```bash
roslaunch pcl_ros vehicle_cropbox_filter.launch
```

### 5. 启动 registered_scan_to_scan

```bash
roslaunch pointcloud_to_laserscan registered_scan_to_scan.launch
```

### 6. 启动 sim_terrain

```bash
roslaunch terrain_analysis_ext sim_terrain.launch
```

### 7. 启动 localplanner

这里对应 `local_planner.launch`：

```bash
roslaunch local_planner local_planner.launch
```

### 8. 启动 senser_scan

这里对应 `sensor_scan_generation.launch`：

```bash
roslaunch sensor_scan_generation sensor_scan_generation.launch
```

### 9. 启动 explore_robocup

```bash
roslaunch tare_planner explore_robocup.launch
```

### 10. 启动 person 识别

```bash
roslaunch visual_obstacle_detector person_global_localizer.launch
```

### 11. 启动 qr 识别

```bash
roslaunch visual_obstacle_detector qr_global_localizer.launch
```

### 12. 启动 damiao

当前仓库里没有现成的 `damiao.launch`，对应的是底盘控制节点：

```bash
rosrun control damiao_diff_chassis_node
```

### 13. 启动 hector

```bash
roslaunch hector_slam_launch hector.launch
```

## 一份总表

按顺序依次执行：

```bash
roslaunch rebo24 display.launch model:=$(rospack find rebo24)/urdf/rebo24.urdf
roslaunch rebo24 sensor.launch
roslaunch fast_lio mapping_velodyne.launch
roslaunch pcl_ros vehicle_cropbox_filter.launch
roslaunch pointcloud_to_laserscan registered_scan_to_scan.launch
roslaunch terrain_analysis_ext sim_terrain.launch
roslaunch local_planner local_planner.launch
roslaunch sensor_scan_generation sensor_scan_generation.launch
roslaunch tare_planner explore_robocup.launch
roslaunch visual_obstacle_detector person_global_localizer.launch
roslaunch visual_obstacle_detector qr_global_localizer.launch
rosrun control damiao_diff_chassis_node
roslaunch hector_slam_launch hector.launch
```

## 备注

- `senser` 在仓库里对应的是 `sensor.launch`。
- `senser_scan` 在仓库里对应的是 `sensor_scan_generation.launch`。
- `damiao` 目前是节点，不是 launch 文件，所以使用 `rosrun` 启动。
- `sim_terrain.launch` 内部已经包含 `loam_interface`、`terrain_analysis` 和 `terrain_analysis_ext`。
